{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51075","headline":"七言记德诗三十首谨献司徒相公 磻溪 · 崔致远","name":"七言记德诗三十首谨献司徒相公 磻溪","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"刻石书踪妙入神，一廻窥览一廻新。\n况能早逐王师业，桃李终成万代春。\n（原注：伏覩相公《磻溪诗》云：「及到王师身已老，不知辛苦爲何人。\n」又《经虢县诗》云：「手栽桃李十余春，今日经过重建勳。\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔致远","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51075.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51075","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}